# --------------------------------------------------- per-session agent scratch
# Not project documentation. It goes stale the moment a session ends, and one
# of its files still described pre-#18 webhook behaviour — exactly the second
# source of truth that caused this week's confusion. MASTER-PLAN.md is the
# source of truth. Scanned 2026-08-21: no secrets, no customer data.
.handoff/
